@startuml NotificationFlow
actor Teacher
actor Student
participant UI
participant "API Gateway" as APIGW
participant "Backend (Monolith)" as BE
participant "AI Service" as AIS
participant "Orchestrator Agent" as ORCH
participant "Analytics Agent" as ANALYTICS
database "PostgreSQL" as PG
queue "Queue" as Q
participant "Notification Worker" as NW

Teacher -> UI: Send announcement/exam notice
UI -> APIGW: /notifications/send
APIGW -> BE: validate audience
BE -> PG: save notification
BE -> Q: enqueue dispatch (async)

... system-triggered alerts ...
BE -> AIS: check risk/lag
AIS -> ORCH: intent=alerting
ORCH -> ANALYTICS: detect lag/anomaly
ANALYTICS --> ORCH: alert events
ORCH --> AIS
AIS --> BE
BE -> Q: enqueue reminder/alert jobs

Q -> NW: deliver via channel
NW -> PG: update delivery status
NW --> Student: receive reminder/alert (<1 min for exam alert)

alt delivery failed
  NW -> Q: retry with backoff
end
@enduml
